  "description": "A .NET SDK for the Paystack API with a result-based error model, automatic amount-to-subunit conversion, built-in fee absorption, HMAC-SHA512 webhook verification, and ready-made ASP.NET Core DI registration. Covers Transactions, Charges (direct mobile money/OTP/PIN), Settlements, Subaccounts, and transaction splits. Targets .NET 8 and .NET 10.",
